# Clan Berne: "Quarra Blood Potion" (VA_VampBlood). Raxle Berne greets the new Berne vampire in Galom Daeus (10,
# adds "serve me") and sends the player after Volrina Quarra's blood ("serve me": 20, "I will serve you." 1 -- its
# response writes no stage, so 30 never logs in Morrowind.esm). The potion sits in a barrel in Druscashti's lower
# level among the Quarra; brought back ("Quarra Blood Potion"), Raxle takes it (50).
# The barrel's Take All stands in for opening it; `defend` takes the Quarra who attack; `approach` stands in for the
# travel.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance --instance 2 mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --from va_berne_blood_start --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case va_berne_blood_start
approach 0537C5DE
talk raxle berne
expect GetJournalIndex VA_VampBlood == 10
ask serve me
expect GetJournalIndex VA_VampBlood == 20
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex VA_VampBlood == 20
bye
end

case va_berne_blood_potion
run
player->PositionCell 250 -1454 -1715 0 "Druscashti, Lower Level"
until 300 GetPCCell "Druscashti, Lower Level" == 1
defend
wait 60
console 05C880FB.removeallitems player
until 300 player->GetItemCount "p_quarrablood_UNIQUE" >= 1
approach 0537C5DE
talk raxle berne
ask Quarra Blood Potion
expect GetJournalIndex VA_VampBlood == 50
bye
end
